 "html": "\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-regular-font-size wp-elements-54dd3680d14570848fce849c1272bfdc\"><strong>Gyűjtemény 4 db Charles Heidsieck Champagne Display palack &#8211; Eredeti üres palack &#8211; Bár bisztró bárpult kirakati dekoráció</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Ezeket a palackokat a Charles Heidsieck Champagne kifejezetten a bárok és kiskereskedők számára készíti, hogy a drága töltött palackokat ne kelljen a bárpultokon vagy a kirakatokban kiállítani.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A palackban lévő dugó, kosár és fólia teljesen eredeti. De. A palack teljesen üres.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ezeket a palackokat bátran ki lehet rakni akár a tűző napra is. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Ha ilyen demo palackjai vannak a pezsgőjét nem teszi tönkre a napfény vagy a függőleges tárolás.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://champagnemania.com/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\"><strong>Collection 4 Charles Heidsieck Champagne Display bottle &#8211; Original empty bottle &#8211; Bar bistro bar counter window display decoration</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-4 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-regular-font-size wp-elements-5d0c221fbdb1606840674c17f7f9c495\">These bottles are prepared by Charles Heidsieck Champagne specifically for bars and retailers, so that expensive filled bottles don&#8217;t need to be displayed on the bar counters or in shop windows.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The cork, basket, and foil in the bottle are all completely original. But. The bottle is completely empty.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-5 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Now you can get yourself one of these empty bottles and confidently display it on your bar counter. Your expensive champagne won&#8217;t be ruined by sunlight exposure or upright storage.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can use it confidently for even 100 years.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>ChampagneClub.hu &#8211; &#8222;The bubbles vanish, the champagne accessories remain.&#8221;</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Browse our range of champagne accessories, bar equipment and champagne souvenirs!<br>SursumVivere Pannonia</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Imitation champagne bottle, Counterfeit champagne bottle, Faux champagne bottle,<br>Replica champagne bottle, Simulated champagne bottle, Artificial champagne bottle</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Placeholder bottle, Substitute bottle, Mock bottle, Replica bottle, Simulated bottle<br>Stand-in bottle</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-6 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\">Continue browsing our <strong>Charles Heidsieck Champagne accessories and gifts</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-7 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-larger-font-size\">Böngésszen tovább <strong>Charles Heidsieck Champagne kellékeink és ajándéktárgyaink között</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-8 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-larger-font-size wp-elements-585d4634de97e56783fe2d770adc22ac\"><strong>Charles Heidsieck pezsgőkóstolók Budapesten</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>A ChampagneClub.hu bárjában, vagy külső helyszínen, akár a kertjében, vagy a teraszán.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right\">Érdeklődés és időpont egyeztetés: </p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-larger-font-size\"><strong>Fémszerkezetű lámpatestek és világító építészeti elemek tervezése, kivitelezése és helyszíni szerelése Budapesten.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Design, construction and on-site installation of metal structure luminaires and lighting architectural elements in Budapest.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-regular-font-size\"><a href=\"https://sursumvivere.hu/\"><strong>www.sursumvivere.hu</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-9 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"></figure>\n</figure>\n",
